      "why": "With creatures of total power 10 or greater (Craterhoof 8 + Endbringer 2) the Bridge's {G},{T} 'you may play the exiled card' ability is a legal activation: the condition gate is met, so activating it pays {G} and taps the Bridge. The harness cannot pre-set ExiledWith, so a card is not actually played; that the activation is offered and its cost paid is the observable claim.",
